  "label": "teenage goat is mapped to mating goats",
  "description": "The top text 'when you catch your teenage goat' is mapped onto the visual scene of two goats mating. The meme equates the visual depiction of goats engaging in sexual behavior with the textual concept of a 'teenage goat', creating an analogical mapping where the visual entity (goats_mating) represents the textual entity (teenage_goat). This mapping is central to the meme's crude metaphor, using animal behavior to crudely represent a human teenage sexual debut.",
